Verification requirement: For every line range you identify, double-check that the exact target column name (as a string literal like `'target_column'` or `df['target_column']`) actually appears on that exact line in the code script. Do not estimate or guess line numbers; verify the line index strictly. Group consecutive matching line numbers into a single range.

Output only JSON: { "sources": [{ "start_line": int, "end_line": int }, ...] }
